-- coa16-part19-supplementary.l4: the Companies Act 2006, Part 19 (Debentures), "Supplementary provisions": ss 749 to 754
-- (lines 9762-9812 of ukpga-2006-46.txt).  Layer 1: the law, objectively, from the text alone.
